  "text_content": "Menu Student Files Classes Instructor Open submenu Reports Open submenu Set Class Schedule School Permits Close submenu Instructor Instructor Schedule Open submenu Instructor Reports Open submenu My Signatures Close submenu Instructor Schedule Booked Appointments Specify Hours Close submenu Instructor Reports Work Summary To Do Lists Close submenu Reports AQTR Registrations Ilan Preisler logout Self-Evaluation of In-Car Session Practical Session #10 McSharry, Annie 1. In the Learner's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? Full stops at stop signs, don’t cross stop sign, check blind spot no longer than two seconds on highway. Improve parking. 2. In the Instructor's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? Good basic control of car. To work on situational awareness, searching for what pertinent in that particular time and selecting the appropriate plan of action. Ready for phase 4. Student Student Signature McSharry, Annie Nov 22, 2025 Instructor Instructor Signature Anatoli Touranski L-XXX Save",
